Statement of Purpose WHEREAS, the Borrower, the Lenders party thereto and the Administrative Agent are parties to the Existing Credit Agreement, pursuant to which such Lenders have extended certain credit facilities to the Borrower, including, without limitation, the Revolving Credit Facility, the Initial Term B-1 Facility and the Initial Term A Facility (each as defined in the Existing Credit Agreement); WHEREAS, the Borrower has requested (a) a Revolving Credit Facility Increase (such increase, the “2026 Revolving Increase”) such that, after giving effect to such Revolving Credit Facility Increase, the aggregate amount of the Revolving Credit Commitment under the Amended Credit Agreement shall be equal to $600,000,000, (b) an extension of the Revolving Credit Maturity Date as set forth in Annex A hereto (the “Revolving Facility Extension”), and (c) certain other changes to the Existing Credit Agreement in connection therewith, in each case as more fully set forth herein;

11. Agreement Regarding Revolving Credit Facility; Departing Lenders. (a) Upon the effectiveness of this Agreement, the aggregate principal amount of the Revolving Credit Facility shall be increased to $600,000,000 on the terms set forth in Annex A hereto. The Revolving Credit Commitment of each Revolving Credit Lender on the Third Amendment Effective Date is set forth opposite the name of such Lender on Annex B hereto.

PRELIMINARY STATEMENTS: The Borrower has requested that the Lenders provide a term B loan facility and a revolving credit facility, and the Lenders have indicated their willingness to lend and each of the L/C Issuers has indicated its willingness to issue letters of credit, in each case, on the terms and subject to the conditions set forth herein.

issues) commercial paper rated as described in clause (c) of this definition or (y) has combined capital and surplus of at least $500,000,000, in each case with maturities of not more than one year from the date of acquisition thereof;

